The tokenizer tests of html5lib-tests (https://github.com/html5lib/html5lib-tests),
under the MIT licence (LICENSE), at commit c5495c539ca8a79c3c5107f5f14010bcff9a35d5
(2026-11-05): its tokenizer/ directory, unchanged. The format is described in
tokenizer/README.md.

Ariadne's HTML tokenizer (ariadne/, doc/decisions/browser.md) is checked
against them on the host: tools/test-ariadne.sh.
